  "description": "The complete DMR Sect dirt jump bike features the same renowned dirt geometry found in our custom DMR Sect frame. It includes a super short rear end and a 69º head angle for enhanced stability. The design also allows for great toe clearance for barspins and a low standover height for tailwhips.\nIn fact, much of the DMR Sect complete bike's DNA is derived from our after-market DMR Sect frame, incorporating 4130 chromoly tubing for an excellent strength-to-weight ratio, integrated headset cups, and a threaded Euro bottom bracket (BB) for easy servicing. The new Sect complete bike is equipped with hydroformed chainstays and an integrated yoke to maximize tyre clearance, as well as an integrated seat clamp to reduce weight.\nAdditionally, the DMR Sect complete dirt bike now features a tapered head tube, providing maximum fork compatibility. This model comes with the new RST Dirt Fork, which includes an upgraded chromoly steerer and rebound damping adjustment, allowing you to customize the fork's setup to your specifications.\nWe've outfitted the DMR Sect Bike with a selection of premium dirt jump components. Spec includes DMR handlebars, DMR Sect grips (a favourite among trail riders), DMR V6 pedals, and Tektro hydraulic brakes both front and rear. The two-piece forged aluminum crankset has an integrated axle and external BB, along with an Odyssey 13t micro-drive and a YBN half link chain.\nIf you're searching for a complete dirt jump bike that's perfect for all-day sessions at the dirt jumps and offers room for progression at the pump track, the Sect Pro is your best option. See you at the trails.",
